{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Adventure</strong> \u2013 Explore a vibrant world inspired by traditional RPGs with strategic <strong>turn-based combat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit &amp; Control</strong> \u2013 Build your team by recruiting a wide variety of <strong>animal-themed characters</strong>\u2014and even turn enemies into allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong> \u2013 Equip characters with color-tiered\u00a0<strong>weapons, armor, and spells</strong> to craft your ideal party setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overworld &amp; Dungeon Battles</strong> \u2013 Fight enemies in open-world encounters and <strong>delve into dangerous dungeons</strong> to gain experience and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World Systems</strong> \u2013 Experience immersive <strong>3D environments</strong> and an evolving <strong>in-game weather system</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Craft</strong> \u2013 Harvest resources through <strong>mining, fishing, and woodcutting</strong> to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Roster</strong> \u2013 Discover and recruit new animal allies as you progress and expand your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More to Discover</strong> \u2013 Packed with surprises and secrets you\u2019ll uncover as you play.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2839180?t=1768146029","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768146029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768146029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.a